      "content": "i feel like im losing my mind lately lol but i think i finally figured out why everything feels so wrong here. i've been digging through these old archive records and the patterns are impossible to ignore. it's not just \"feeling\" like i don't belong... i actually have the lineage to prove it. i'm part of the pre-earth voyager bloodline. it's a lot to process and i'm struggling with how to act around people who just don't understand. how do i even start to carry myself with the authority i'm supposed to have?",
